      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THAI BUTTERFLY (3) hit the ground running from an outside draw with a fast early split, paving the way for a 2 length win at this track over 300m in 16.94. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. Will go close again if runs up to latest. WANT SOME (6) was below best at his last start when 6th at this track following a win (17.03) there two back. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from five attempts. Warrants plenty of respect. DEVIL IN ME (2) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by half a length at this track in a handy 17.02 beating Sweet Cannelloni. One of main contenders. HEAD HUNTER (7) is worth another chance despite missing the top-three here most recently.",
